    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "钻井液在井筒里承担三件事：压住地层、带出岩屑、冷却钻头。它的密度决定井底压力，而安全区间常常只有 0.04 g/cm³ 宽——高一点压漏地层，低一点地层流体就进来。这个案例的核心不是「把密度算准」，而是「在测不到的地方也能判断自己偏了没有」。",
      "judge": [
        { "label": "任务类型", "value": "软测量 + 推荐", "desc": "从循环参数反推性能，再推加量" },
        { "label": "数据门槛", "value": "班测 + 高频循环", "desc": "性能测量每班只有 1—2 次" },
        { "label": "可见收益", "value": "减少井漏与过调", "desc": "把「事后补救」变成「事前微调」" },
        { "label": "难度", "value": "中", "html": "<span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span>", "desc": "测量稀疏，需多源融合" }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>井底压力由两件事决定：钻井液的<b>静液柱压力</b>（由密度算出），和循环时额外增加的<b>当量循环密度 ECD</b>（由环空摩阻算出）。安全条件是三个压力排好队：孔隙压力 &lt; 液柱压力 &lt; 破裂压力。中间这段就是「密度窗口」。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 270' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='密度窗口随井深变窄'><rect width='620' height='270' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='56' y='26' width='414' height='200' fill='none' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><line x1='112' y1='26' x2='112' y2='226' stroke='#f4f1e9' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><line x1='224' y1='26' x2='224' y2='226' stroke='#f4f1e9' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><line x1='336' y1='26' x2='336' y2='226' stroke='#f4f1e9' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><line x1='448' y1='26' x2='448' y2='226' stroke='#f4f1e9' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><path d='M112 26 L291 226 L336 226 L448 26 Z' fill='#e6f1ec' fill-opacity='.75'/><path d='M112 26 L291 226' fill='none' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.7'/><path d='M448 26 L336 226' fill='none' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='1.7'/><line x1='302' y1='26' x2='302' y2='226' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.9' stroke-dasharray='5 3'/><path d='M373 175 V196' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M369 175 H377 M369 196 H377' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.4'/><text x='382' y='182' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51' font-weight='600'>窄窗口段</text><text x='382' y='194' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9'>余量 &lt; 0.04</text><text x='112' y='248' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1.30</text><text x='224' y='248' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1.40</text><text x='336' y='248' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1.50</text><text x='448' y='248' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1.60</text><text x='470' y='248' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>当量密度 g/cm³ →</text><text x='50' y='22' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>3200</text><text x='50' y='226' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>4100</text><text x='6' y='126' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>井深 m</text><text x='130' y='20' font-size='8' fill='#41699b' font-weight='600'>孔隙压力</text><text x='430' y='20' font-size='8' fill='#b26a39' font-weight='600'>破裂压力</text><text x='308' y='20' font-size='8' fill='#2f7d6b' font-weight='600'>ECD</text><text x='56' y='262' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>绿色带即安全窗口：越往深部越窄，到井底余量可能只剩 0.04</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　绿色带是安全窗口：下界是孔隙压力（低一点气侵），上界是破裂压力（高一点井漏）。<b>窗口随井深变窄</b>——这是深井钻井液最难的地方：同样的操作，浅部有富余，深部没有。</p><p>难点还在于性能不是连续测的。密度、黏度、滤失量按班测量，每 12 小时才 1—2 个点；而井下工况每几分钟就在变。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 176' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='班测的阶梯与真实变化'><rect width='620' height='176' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='34' y='26' width='568' height='112' fill='#fdfcf9' fill-opacity='.6'/><rect x='384' y='26' width='92' height='112' fill='#f9e9e5' fill-opacity='.7'/><text x='430' y='40' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>未被测量的偏离</text><line x1='34' y1='138' x2='602' y2='138' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><path d='M34 96 C 90 92 140 100 190 88 C 240 76 280 94 330 82 C 370 72 400 60 440 48 C 480 40 520 60 560 66' fill='none' stroke='#4d565b' stroke-width='1.5' stroke-linejoin='round'/><path d='M34 98 H164 V86 H314 V78 H464 V64 H602' fill='none' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-width='1.8' stroke-linejoin='round'/><circle cx='164' cy='86' r='2.8' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='314' cy='78' r='2.8' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='464' cy='64' r='2.8' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='164' y='152' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>班测</text><text x='314' y='152' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>班测</text><text x='464' y='152' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>班测</text><text x='602' y='152' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end'>时间 →</text><text x='34' y='170' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>阶梯是「按班测量」的结果，平滑线是真实变化</text><text x='600' y='170' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='end'>测量点之间那段，就是控制滞后的来源</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　粉色区就是问题本身：<b>工况已经变了，但下一次班测还没到</b>。人工判断只能靠经验猜，或者等——而等，往往就是等来一次井漏。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>把「测不到」变成「算得出」：用高频循环参数与稀疏实验室测量训练软测量模型，再往前推一步做趋势预测。<b>输出带区间，否则工程师不敢用</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻井液调控的五个环节'><rect width='620' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='18' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01 · FUSE</text><text x='18' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>多源融合</text><text x='18' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>循环参数 + 班测</text><text x='18' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>迟到校正</text><path d='M121 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M129 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='141' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02 · SOFT</text><text x='141' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>性能软测量</text><text x='141' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>密度 / 黏度</text><text x='141' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>机理骨架 + 残差</text><path d='M244 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M252 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03 · TREND</text><text x='264' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>趋势预测</text><text x='264' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>未来 12 h</text><text x='264' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>标出何时出窗</text><path d='M367 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M375 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='387' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04 · DOSE</text><text x='387' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>加量推荐</text><text x='387' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>限幅、分次</text><text x='387' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>先稀释后加重</text><path d='M490 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M498 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='510' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>05 · VERIFY</text><text x='510' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>复测校准</text><text x='510' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>预测 vs 实测</text><text x='510' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>超阈值就校准</text><text x='310' y='114' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>第 5 步不能省：每次班测都是对软测量的一次免费校准</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第 5 步是这个方案里性价比最高的部分：<b>系统自己不产生标签，但它会用自己的预测去等下一次实测</b>。在一个标签只有每班 1—2 个的任务里，这种「等标签」的设计决定模型能不能长期可信。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style='margin-bottom:14px'>典型「高频参数 + 稀疏标签」，两者比例可能到 10000:1。先看清这个差距，再决定模型复杂度——<b>这个比例下，任何「大模型直接学」都是错的</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='钻井液相关数据的采样频次'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>SAMPLING · 一万个参数点，一个标签</text><line x1='106' y1='22' x2='106' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='106' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1s</text><line x1='222' y1='22' x2='222' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='222' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1m</text><line x1='339' y1='22' x2='339' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='339' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1h</text><line x1='429' y1='22' x2='429' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='429' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1d</text><line x1='526' y1='22' x2='526' y2='134' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-dasharray='2 4'/><text x='526' y='148' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>30d</text><text x='98' y='38' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>循环参数</text><line x1='106' y1='34' x2='172' y2='34' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='106' cy='34' r='2.4' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='534' y='38' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1—10 s</text><text x='98' y='62' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>池体积</text><line x1='222' y1='58' x2='268' y2='58' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='222' cy='58' r='2.4' fill='#41699b'/><text x='534' y='62' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1—5 min</text><text x='98' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>加量记录</text><line x1='339' y1='82' x2='390' y2='82' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='3.2' stroke-linecap='round'/><circle cx='339' cy='82' r='2.4' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='534' y='86' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>按次</text><text x='98' y='110' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>性能测量</text><circle cx='409' cy='106' r='3' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='534' y='110' font-size='8' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' font-weight='600'>12 h</text><text x='98' y='134' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>井身结构</text><circle cx='429' cy='130' r='3' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='534' y='134' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>单井一次</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第三、四行才是标签，但它们的频次比前两行低四个数量级。这就是为什么这条路线必须是「机理骨架 + 数据补残差」，而不是端到端监督学习。</p><p style='margin-top:12px'><b>数据准备清单</b></p><p>· <b>钻井液性能测量</b>：密度、黏度、滤失、含砂，每班 1—2 次<br>· <b>循环与返出参数</b>：流量、温度、立压、池体积，高频<br>· <b>处理剂加量记录</b>：类型、加量、时间，作为<b>动作标签</b><br>· <b>井身结构与地层压力</b>：套管程序、压力剖面，用于计算窗口</p><p><b>最容易漏的一条</b>　「加量记录」通常写在班报的自由文本里。<b>它不结构化，就没有动作标签，模型只能预测、不能推荐</b>——这是很多项目卡住的地方。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px'><span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span><span style='font-size:12px;color:#79828a'>机理清楚、参数高频；难在测量稀疏与「过调」的振荡。</span></div><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='难度分解'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY HARD · 难度来自哪一项</text><text x='102' y='36' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>数据可得性</text><rect x='110' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='36' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>循环参数高频</text><text x='102' y='61' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>标签稀疏度</text><rect x='110' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='61' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>每班 1—2 次</text><text x='102' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>闭环风险</text><rect x='110' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>加错剂量代价可控</text><text x='102' y='111' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>可解释性</text><rect x='110' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='111' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>需说明为什么加</text><rect x='110' y='128' width='300' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='110' y='146' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>风险相对可控 → 钻井环节里最适合先做闭环的一类</text><text x='418' y='36' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>难度分级</text><rect x='418' y='44' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='53' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>低</text><rect x='418' y='60' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='69' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>中</text><rect x='418' y='76' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='85' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>高</text><text x='418' y='118' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>落地顺序</text><text x='418' y='133' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>① 软测量（只算不推）</text><text x='418' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>② 趋势预测</text><text x='418' y='159' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>③ 加量推荐</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　只有「标签稀疏度」是 3 格，其余都在可接受范围。<b>这就是为什么它比轨迹控制更适合先做闭环</b>：加错剂量可以稀释回调，不像轨迹那样不可逆。</p><p><b>落地顺序</b>　先做「软测量 + 趋势」，让工程师看到「算出来的密度和实测对得上」，再谈加量推荐。反过来做，推荐一定会被当成噪音。</p><p><b>可借鉴的通用技术</b>　软测量 · 多源融合 · 推荐系统 · 机理约束建模</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "en": "WHAT · WHY · HOW",
          "title": "AI 方法拆解：用了什么、为什么、怎么起作用",
          "html": "<p>这个案例的 AI 份额其实很小：<b>八成工作是把机理模型搭对，两成是让残差被数据修正</b>。这是很多工业场景的真实比例——认识到这一点，才不会把预算全花在模型上。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 230' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='WHAT WHY HOW 三联'><rect width='620' height='230' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHAT · 用了什么</text><text x='18' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>机理骨架 + 残差补正</text><text x='18' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>三件东西，各有分工：</text><text x='18' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>① 质量/体积 → 密度（规则）</text><text x='18' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>② 排量 → ECD（半经验式）</text><text x='18' y='100' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>③ 残差 → 数据模型补</text><rect x='18' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='47' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='47' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>物理</text><rect x='82' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='111' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='111' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>残差</text><rect x='146' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='175' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='175' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>限幅</text><text x='18' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>注意 ① 与 ② 里没有一个可训练参数。</text><text x='18' y='190' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>它们不是「模型」，但把问题的维度从</text><text x='18' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>上百维压到了十几维——这才让</text><text x='18' y='218' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>稀疏标签下的学习成为可能。</text><rect x='212' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY · 为什么</text><text x='224' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>测量稀疏到 10000:1</text><text x='224' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>循环参数每秒一个点，性能测量</text><text x='224' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>每 12 小时 1—2 次。</text><text x='224' y='96' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>循环参数</text><rect x='232' y='87' width='150' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.8'/><text x='224' y='122' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>性能测量</text><rect x='232' y='113' width='3' height='11' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='242' y='122' font-size='8.2' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1/43200</text><text x='224' y='150' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>再看后果：纯数据驱动会教科书式地</text><text x='224' y='164' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>过拟合——它会把「这一班的操作习惯」</text><text x='224' y='178' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>学成「地层规律」。</text><text x='224' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>所以必须先用机理把维度压下来，</text><text x='224' y='217' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>再用少量测量校准。</text><rect x='418' y='6' width='196' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='430' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>HOW · 怎么起作用</text><text x='430' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>每次班测都是免费校准</text><text x='430' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>闭环三件事，缺一不可：</text><rect x='430' y='68' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 74 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='78' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>预测值当班落库</text><rect x='430' y='88' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 94 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='98' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>班测结果自动比对</text><rect x='430' y='108' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 114 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='118' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>偏差超阈值触发校准</text><text x='430' y='144' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>再加一条工程约束：</text><rect x='430' y='152' width='172' height='30' rx='5' fill='#f9efd7' stroke='#a97a1c' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='165' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12'>单次加量限幅，宁可两次到位</text><text x='440' y='177' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12'>也不要一次加过头</text><text x='430' y='200' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>这条不是模型，但它决定系统</text><text x='430' y='214' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>会不会把井调成振荡。</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左：用了什么（注意前两步没有可训练参数）。中：为什么非它不可。右：它凭什么有用，以及那条不属于 AI 但决定成败的工程约束。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },

    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：一个窄窗口井段的钻井液调控",
      "lead": [
        "目标：在密度窗口只有 0.04 g/cm³ 的井段，把**井漏次数从 3 次降到 0**，同时把处理剂加量波动压到 ±15% 以内。",
        "「波动」这个指标常被忽略，但它正是过调的直接体现——**井漏往往不是密度算错，而是调过头**。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        ["井段", "3200—4100 m"],
        ["窗口宽度", "0.04"],
        ["井漏", "3 → 0"],
        ["加量波动", "±15%"]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "多源融合与迟到校正",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "把返出参数按迟到时间对齐到井深，再把班测结果挂到对应时刻。",
          "effect": "让「测量」和「参数」落在同一个时间点",
          "trap": "迟到时间算错，等于把标签整体平移——**这是最土却最关键的一步，它错了后面所有模型都在学错位的关系**"
        },
        {
          "name": "性能软测量",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "用机理关系做骨架（质量/体积、排量→ECD），用数据模型补残差。",
          "effect": "把每班 1 个点变成每分钟 1 个点",
          "trap": "纯数据驱动在标签稀疏时必然过拟合，会把操作习惯学成地层规律"
        },
        {
          "name": "趋势预测",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "预测未来 12 小时的密度与滤失趋势并给出区间，标出「何时会出窗口」。",
          "effect": "把控制从事后变成事前",
          "trap": "只报当前值，等于没有提前量——**工程师要的是两小时后会不会漏，不是现在多少**"
        },
        {
          "name": "处理剂加量推荐",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "按「先稀释、后加重」的顺序给出建议，并限制单次调整幅度。",
          "effect": "避免过调造成的振荡",
          "trap": "一次加太多，下一班又要回调，越调越乱——**振荡比偏差更危险**"
        },
        {
          "name": "复测与模型更新",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "下一次班测后自动比对预测与实测，偏差超阈值就触发校准。",
          "effect": "模型随井况自动漂移",
          "trap": "没有闭环，软测量三个月后就不可信，而且没人会发现"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "五步要点：每一步产出什么、验收什么",
        "html": "<p>下面五张图对应上面五步。<b>第 1 步和第 5 步不含任何模型，但它们分别决定了「输入对不对」和「输出还能不能信」</b>。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第一步 迟到校正'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 01 · 迟到校正 · 迟到时间 = 井深 ÷ 返速</text><line x1='24' y1='70' x2='600' y2='70' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><path d='M24 70 L520 70' stroke='#e9e4d8' stroke-width='14'/><rect x='520' y='60' width='28' height='20' rx='3' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='534' y='96' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle'>钻头</text><path d='M470 62 V34' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M467 38 l3-6 l3 6z' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='470' y='30' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle'>岩屑上返</text><path d='M400 84 H520' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M400 84 l6-2.6v5.2z' fill='#41699b'/><path d='M520 84 l-6-2.6v5.2z' fill='#41699b'/><text x='460' y='100' font-size='7.6' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>这段 = 迟到时间内又钻进了 8.2 m</text><text x='0' y='108' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>排量一变，迟到时间跟着变：固定值会让整份描述错位</text><text x='300' y='30' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：排量变化前后，同一深度点的两条曲线能对上</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第二步 软测量'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 02 · 软测量 · 在班测点上误差要小于窗口的 1/3</text><line x1='40' y1='100' x2='270' y2='100' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='40' y1='100' x2='40' y2='24' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><line x1='40' y1='100' x2='270' y2='24' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-dasharray='4 4'/><circle cx='70' cy='92' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='100' cy='82' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='130' cy='74' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='160' cy='62' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='190' cy='52' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='220' cy='42' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><circle cx='250' cy='32' r='2.6' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='270' y='112' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>实测密度 →</text><text x='36' y='28' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='end' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>算</text><rect x='300' y='22' width='316' height='84' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='312' y='38' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>为什么是 1/3</text><text x='312' y='56' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>窗口只剩 0.04 时，误差若到 0.02，</text><text x='312' y='70' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>算出来的值就等于"抛硬币"。</text><text x='312' y='90' font-size='8.2' fill='#242b2e'>验收：班测点误差 &lt; 窗口宽度 ÷ 3</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>达不到这条，后续趋势预测与推荐都不必谈</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第三步 趋势预测'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 03 · 趋势预测 · 提前说出"两小时后会出窗"</text><line x1='40' y1='96' x2='600' y2='96' stroke='#ddd7c8'/><rect x='380' y='26' width='220' height='70' fill='#f9e9e5' fill-opacity='.55'/><line x1='380' y1='26' x2='380' y2='96' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><text x='386' y='38' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51' font-weight='600'>预测出窗</text><path d='M40 84 C 120 82 200 76 280 66 C 340 58 380 46 440 34 C 500 26 560 22 600 20' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.7'/><path d='M40 88 C 120 86 200 82 280 74 C 340 68 380 60 440 50' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3' stroke-opacity='.6'/><circle cx='280' cy='66' r='3.2' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='280' y='58' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>当前</text><text x='40' y='112' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>实线为已发生，虚线为区间下界；出窗越早被说出，处置选项越多</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第四步 加量推荐限幅'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 04 · 加量推荐 · 限幅，分次，别振荡</text><rect x='0' y='22' width='296' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 一次加足</text><line x1='12' y1='80' x2='282' y2='80' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><path d='M12 80 C 40 30 68 96 96 44 C 124 96 152 48 180 88 C 208 56 236 84 264 70' fill='none' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='12' y='100' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>密度在窗口两侧反复穿越</text><rect x='312' y='22' width='308' height='84' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='324' y='38' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 限幅分次</text><line x1='324' y1='80' x2='606' y2='80' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-dasharray='3 3'/><path d='M324 80 C 356 62 388 44 424 34 C 470 24 540 22 606 22' fill='none' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='324' y='100' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>单调逼近目标，无回调</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：相邻两次调整幅度的变异系数 &lt; 15%</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第五步 复测校准'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 05 · 复测校准 · 每次班测都是一次免费校准</text><rect x='0' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='12' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>预测落库</text><rect x='160' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='172' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='172' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>班测比对</text><rect x='320' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#e7eef9' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='332' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='332' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>偏差判定</text><rect x='480' y='26' width='136' height='44' rx='7' fill='#f1f1dd' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='492' y='44' font-size='8' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04</text><text x='492' y='60' font-size='9.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>校准系数</text><path d='M136 48h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M156 48l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><path d='M296 48h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M316 48l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><path d='M456 48h20' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M476 48l-5-3v6z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><path d='M548 74v14 H68 v-14' fill='none' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-width='1' stroke-dasharray='4 3' stroke-opacity='.7'/><path d='M68 74l-3.4 5h6.8z' fill='#767a2e' fill-opacity='.7'/><text x='0' y='108' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>偏差超阈值就校准；不超阈值也要留档，用来监控漂移趋势</text></svg><p style='margin-top:14px'><b>怎么算「调得稳」</b></p><table class='dtable'><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>本例取值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>出窗时长</td><td>密度落在窗口外的小时数</td><td>0 h</td></tr><tr><td>井漏次数</td><td>井段内漏失事件</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>加量波动</td><td>相邻两次调整幅度的变异系数</td><td>±13%</td></tr><tr><td>软测量误差</td><td>班测点上的相对误差</td><td>4.1%</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:12px'>不要只看「有没有漏」。要看<b>在窗口内待了多久</b>，以及<b>调整幅度是否收敛</b>——后者是预防下一次漏的关键。</p>"
      },
      "fails": [
        { "name": "迟到时间错位", "why": "排量变化后迟到时间随之变化，固定值会让标签整体平移。解决方向：按排量实时计算迟到时间，逐段重算。" },
        { "name": "过调振荡", "why": "一次加足剂量，下一班又回调，越调越乱。解决方向：限制单次调整幅度 + 分次到位，并把波动率纳入验收。" },
        { "name": "窗口用了旧数据", "why": "破裂压力来自邻井或设计值，实际可能低很多。解决方向：把本井漏失事件作为上界修正依据。" }
      ]
    },

    "demo": {
